Type: Package
Package: RFDose
Title: Deterministic and stochastic radiofrequency electromagnetic field
    (RF-EMF) dose calculator
Version: 2.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Irina", "Wipf", , "irina.wipf@swisstph.ch", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hamed", "Jalilian", role = "ctb"),
    person("Nicolas", "Loizeau", , "nicolas.loizeau@swisstph.ch", role = "aut"),
    person("Gianni", "Ardielli", role = "aut"),
    person("Fabrice", "Keller", role = "aut"),
    person("Martin", "Röösli", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Package for calculating RF-EMF doses for cohorts. Calculates
    the daily RF-EMF dose of the brain and the whole body from the
    self-reported use of wireless devices and the environment, with SAR
    values from the GOLIAT dosimetric simulations. A stochastic version
    estimates the uncertainty of the doses by drawing the parameters, SAR
    values and inputs from their distributions.
